Je suis une grande fan, Blunt Sister.

00:11:41.491 --> 00:11:42.492
Quoi?

00:11:42.492 --> 00:11:43.527
Cho Na Jeong.

00:11:43.827 --> 00:11:46.463
Je t'avais dit de jouer dur,
